        "text": "I've read the three reports. Key alignment facts:\n\n**Consensus (aligned across the three views):**\n- Data baseline: 39.56 元 (2026-08-09); latest price 38.99 元 (2026-08-22, -1.4%)\n- Market cap: 127.5 亿 (39.56 × 3.2232亿股 = 127.51亿)\n- PE(TTM): 13.18 (two sources consistent)\n- ROE: 年报加权 26.98% (速评卡 31.0% rolling annualized; Tushare 24.31% — use annual report 26.98%)\n- Gross margin: 94.22%; 新活素 single product ~95%\n- 2025 归母净利 9.38亿 (-10.78% due to government subsidy decrease; 扣非 +1.48%)\n- 经营现金流 10.05亿, 净现比 1.07\n- 分红 5.63亿, 60% payout, ~4% dividend yield, 3 consecutive years\n- Net cash: 货币资金 23.27亿 + 交易性金融资产 11.23亿 ≈ 34.5亿 (~27% of market cap)\n- 新活素 86.02% of revenue; 2025 sales 734.59万支 (+4.82%)\n- 医保常规目录 since 2025-12, 424.98元/支 locked price\n- Patent expires 2031-12; 兰鼎生物 approved 2025-04-30 (423.98元/支, 1 yuan cheaper); 步长生物 2026-07-22 supplemental application accepted\n- Competitor erosion: 3-5 years, 10-20% share loss; leadership until ~2030\n- 诺欣妥 entered 12th batch 集采 2026-07; SGLT2i rising\n- Second curve: 依姆多 +31.46%, 诺迪康 +146.31%, 2026 revenue budget 33亿 (+10.7% implied)\n\n**Quantitative conclusions (consensus):**\n- 内在涨幅: +32% (段永平/芒格) vs +39% (巴菲特). The 收敛带: 52.3 (段永平/芒格) ~ 55.0 (巴菲特).\n- 击球区: 🟡\n- 目标建仓价: 44 元\n- 二次补仓价: 36 元\n\nThe task: rewrite/create 风险评估-李录视角.md aligned with these three. The consensus numbers: 内在涨幅 +32%, 建仓 44, 补仓 36, 击球区 🟡. The 李录 risk-assessment perspective can adopt these — the task says \"同一只股票的同一次重研，四个视角的建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅应一致，除非该视角有依据地持不同观点\".\n\nFor 李录's risk-assessment view, the natural alignment: 内在涨幅 +32%, 击球区 🟡, 建仓 44, 补仓 36. That's consistent with 段永平/芒格 (52.3 元 = +32%). The risk view focusing on downside protection would likely take the lower end of the convergence band — +32% makes sense, consistent with 段永平 and 芒格.\n\nNow let me look at an existing 风险评估-李录视角.md to understand the methodology/format. Let me read a recent pharma one, e.g., 600285羚锐制药-风险评估-李录视角-20260819.md or 600276恒瑞医药-风险评估-李录视角.md. Since 